1. Open Storybook / serve locally with `en-US` locale — calendar should still show Sunday first, dates in correct columns.
2. Change locale to `fr-FR` or `de-DE` — calendar should show Monday first, dates shift to correct columns matching the header.
3. Test a month whose 1st is a Sunday (e.g., January 2023) with `fr-FR` — should show 6 empty cells before day 1 (Mon–Sat of prev week).
4. Test with a `startDate` that is not the 1st — verify column alignment still correct.
